00:05:18.689 --> 00:05:19.118
[G


00:05:19.118 --> 00:05:19.549
[GM


00:05:19.549 --> 00:05:19.978
[GMT


00:05:19.978 --> 00:05:20.408
[GMTe


00:05:20.408 --> 00:05:20.838
[GMTea


00:05:20.838 --> 00:05:21.266
